</style>
<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1026)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Scale and rotate marks.</b> A selected mark has handles: drag a corner to scale it in proportion (&#8679; frees the proportions, &#8997; scales from the centre), an edge to stretch it, and the knob above to rotate a stroke, line or arrow (&#8679; snaps to 15&#176;). Line weight stays as drawn; text grows with a corner.</li>
<li><b>Select several marks.</b> &#8679;-click adds or removes a mark; &#8679;-drag across the picture selects every mark the box touches. Move, scale, recolor or delete them together.</li>
<li>The web page does the same, and every seat sees the result.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
